WEBVTT

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.960
Monsters University!
Anybody getting off?

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:29.640
(SIGHS)

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.800
Well, everyone,
I don't mean to get emotional,

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:34.400
but everything in my life
has led to this moment.

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:36.200
Let it not be
just the beginning of my dream

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:37.920
but the beginning of all of our dreams.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Gladys, promise me
you'll keep auditioning.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.160
Marie, Mr. Right is out there somewhere.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:44.480
Phil, keep using the ointment
till that thing goes away.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:47.360
I wish you all the best.
Thank you all so much!

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:49.160
(MIKE PANTING)

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:55.160
I'm welling up with tears. Now, get off.

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:04.960
(EXHALES)

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:07.680
(STUDENTS CHATTERING
INDISTINCTLY)

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:25.360
-Hello. How are you doing?
-(BICYCLE BELL RINGS)

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:27.680
(CHATTERING CONTINUES)

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:34.280
(HEAVY FOOTSTEPS THUDDING)

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:35.360
Ah!

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:38.560
Whoo-hoo!

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:42.520
(CHUCKLES)

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:44.360
COACH: Stroke! Stroke!

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:45.840
Come on, put all you have into it!

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:48.240
Stroke! Stroke!

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:53.160
Okay! First thing on my list,
get registered.

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:55.360
Hey there, freshman. I'm Jay the R.A.,

00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:58.280
and I'm here to say
that registration is thataway!

00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:01.200
-Okay, Jay.
-Have a great first day.

00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:04.080
Hey, I'm Kay!
Here's your orientation packet.

00:02:04.280 --> 00:02:05.400
Thanks, Kay.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:08.360
You can drop your bags off here
and get your picture taken with Trey.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:10.160
-Say hooray!
-Hooray!

00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:12.080
I can't believe it.

00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:15.280
I'm officially a college student!

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:17.120
Okay, everyone, I'm Fay,

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:20.640
and I'll be giving you your
orientation tour on this perfect day!

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:22.440
(TOUR PARTICIPANTS CHATTERING)

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:27.040
FAY: Here are the labs
where students learn

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:29.360
to design and build the doors
to the Human World.

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:36.000
(DOOR BUZZING)

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:38.720
Looks like the professor is
about to test a door!

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:51.200
The MU cafeteria serves a full buffet,
three meals a day.

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:55.440
I personally believe we have
some of the best chefs in the world.

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:59.720
-Oh! Yeah!
-Yeah! (LAUGHS)

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:02.880
The campus offers
a wide variety of majors,

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:07.680
but the crown jewel of MU
is the Scaring School.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:09.200
(ALL MURMURING)

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.840
(STUDENTS CHATTERING
INDISTINCTLY)

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:23.720
Welcome to the Debate Team.
We're happy to have you.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:25.880
I disagree for the following reasons.

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:27.400
True happiness
is a theoretical construct...

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:30.360
Hey there! Keep your eye on the sky

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:32.320
at the Astronomy Club!

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.880
Hey, hey, hey!
Come join the Improv Club.

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:41.200
You'll wish you were a...
Never... Always...

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.280
Ah, dang it!

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:46.160
MU's Greek Council. We sponsor
the annual Scare Games.

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:48.120
(STAMMERS) The Scare what now?

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:49.400
The Scare Games!

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:51.520
A super-intense Scaring competition!

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:54.520
They're crazy dangerous,
so anything could happen.

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:57.360
A bunch of guys went
to the hospital last year!

00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:00.000
-You could totally die.
-And it's worth it.

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:03.040
You get a chance to prove
that you are the best!

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:05.040
MIKE: Cool.

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:08.240
MALE DORM PROCTOR:
Wazowski, Room 319.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:10.560
You know, your roommate
is a Scaring major, too.

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:11.680
(GASPS)

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:14.520
"Hello, I'm your roommate."
Oh, that's too bland.

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:16.560
Don't force it. Just let it happen.

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:20.760
Your lifelong best friend
is right behind this door.

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:23.360
(EXHALES SLOWLY)

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:27.200
(GASPS)

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:29.600
Hey there. I'm your roomie.

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:31.320
Name's Randy Boggs. Scaring major.

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:34.160
Oh! (STAMMERS)
Mike Wazowski, Scaring major.

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:36.080
I can tell we're going to be
best chums, Mike.

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:37.720
Take whichever bed you want.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:39.320
I wanted you to have first dibs.

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:40.400
Ahh!

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:41.920
(GASPS) You just disappeared.

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:45.480
Sorry. If I do that in Scaring class,
I'll be a joke.

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:48.280
No, it's totally great. You got to use it.

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:49.680
-Really?
-Yeah, but lose the glasses.

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:51.440
-They give it away.
-Huh.

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:54.920
(PRACTICES GROWLING)

00:04:58.200 --> 00:04:59.680
(RATTLES)

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:01.240
MIKE: Okay!

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:04.240
Unpack. Check. Hang posters. Check.

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:06.720
Now I just need to ace my classes,
graduate with honors,

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:08.240
and become the greatest Scarer ever.

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:10.680
Boy, I wish I had your confidence, Mike.

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:12.360
Aren't you even a little nervous?

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:14.000
Actually, no.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:17.240
I've been waiting for this my whole life.

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:22.880
I just can't wait to get started.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.840
(STUDENTS CHATTERING
INDISTINCTLY)

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:37.120
(BELL TOLLING)

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:41.720
Oh, man! I can't be late on the first day!

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:43.000
(INHALES DEEPLY)

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:48.080
(PANTING RAPIDLY)

